    "detailed_description": "<strong>OranguTangle</strong>; a casually-intense online-multiplayer game where Orangutans all compete for the title of One Of The Jungle by fighting for victory in various game modes! Return to your primal instincts as a human and compete against your friends for victory by any means necessary; batting away others, swinging with your grapple-arm and becoming what no other can... the One Of The Jungle!<br><br>Features of this game include, but are not limited to:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>A Grapple Arm!</strong> - Swing anywhere with a responsive-feeling, fast grapple arm!</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Seamless Multiplayer!</strong> - Run, jump, and swing with friends all over the world with a seamlessly integrated multiplayer experience!</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Multiple Different Gamemodes</strong> - Including gamemodes such as Speedrunning, Knockout, and Tag, <strong>OranguTangle</strong> is a game for many different types of gamers!</li></ul>",
